claim.claim-text:
1. A swimming pool cleaning device of an underwater robot, comprising:
a cleaning device body (1);
a water inlet component (2) disposed at a bottom of the cleaning device body (1);
a water outlet component (3) disposed at a top of the cleaning device body (1);
a filter screen (11) disposed in the cleaning device body (1) and between the water inlet component (2) and the water outlet component (3); and
a plurality of guide wheels (12) disposed on the bottom of the cleaning device body (1);
wherein the water inlet component (2) includes a water inlet (21) disposed on the bottom of the cleaning device body (1), a soft rubber scraper (22) disposed on one side of the water inlet (21), two water inlet fixing members (23) disposed in a lower cover (102) and on two sides of the water inlet (21), respectively, a three-hole plug (24) hinged to a bottom of the lower cover (102) and disposed on one side of the water inlet (21); and
wherein the soft rubber scraper (22) is detachably mounted on the three-hole plug (24).
